<title>UK: Tsuru Intl sets 56.1 mln Sfr bond with warrants.</title>
<headline>Tsuru Intl sets 56.1 mln Sfr bond with warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by joint lead managers Yamaichi Bank (Switzerland) and Swiss Bank Corporation.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TSURU INTERNATIONAL LTD, CAYMAN ISLANDS</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  THE HOKKAIDO TAKUSHOKU BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT   56.150 MLN SFR COUPON     0.75	MATURITY    01.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE    WARRANTS     ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    01.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	NEG PLG    YES	 GOV LAW    SWISS</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) 50	SALE LIMITS KY/JP/US/UK</p>
<p> NOTES	50 WARRANTS PER NOTE ENTITLING HOLDER TO SUBSCRIBE</p>
<p>		FOR SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY.</p>
<p>		EXERCISE PRICE TO BE FIXED ON 15.OCT.96 AT 2.50 PCT</p>
<p>		ABOVE THE CLOSING PRICE ON THE SAME DAY.</p>
<p>		EXERCISE PERIOD   - 15.NOV.95-25.OCT.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
